msgstr "`coeffs.data`：各反復での係数 $\\boldsymbol\\alpha$ と $\\bar{\\boldsymbol\\alpha}$ の値。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:434
msgid ""
"`bias.<bias-label>.iter-<iteration-number>.data` : Bias potential at "
