msgstr ""
"`bias.<bias-label>.iter-<iteration-number>.data`：反復 <iteration-number> の "
"BiasPotential。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:435
msgid ""
"`fes.<bias-name>.iter-<iteration-number>.data` : FES at iteration "
